Z||000001||tgowens||05-18-2001||01:04 AM||||I do know that the FOCOA site <I>is</I> down and they are trying to restore it. I am, however, working with the Regional Director of FOCOA to create the Western Regional web site which will include the state of WA.<P>This pertains to FOCOA, the club, rather than FOCOA, the business which is still owned and operated by Phil Huff - the business site is the one that is down.<P>Just as a matter of explanation, the club and business are separate entities and are not owned by the same people.<P>------------------<BR>My Fiero Web Site.....<BR><A HREF="http://www.tgowens.com/fiero/index.html" TARGET=_blank><BR>             <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/tgowens.gif">              </A><P>87 GT - 2.8L Gold automatic<BR>87 GT - 2.8L Blue automatic<BR>87 GT - 3.4L Blue 5-speed Getrag<BR>87 GT - 2.8L Med. Red Met. 5-speed Getrag<BR>88 Coupe - 2.5L Red automatic||||reg||1
